      ":question/problem": "![](images/4c/4cbe42587db5bd7163680d6d80707ca65b7f7b89f71c4a1a8a04b9648b39c8d4.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, the parallel lines $l$, $m$, and $n$ are crossed by the transversal $t$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> $\u2220JHK\u2245\u2220AEG$\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $\u2220JHK\u2245\u2220FEH$ | {{field-1}} |\n| 2 | $\u2220AEG\u2245\u2220FEH$ | {{field-2}} |\n| 3 | $\u2220FEH\u2245\u2220AEG$ | Symmetric property of congruence |\n| 4 | $\u2220JHK\u2245\u2220AEG$ | {{field-3}} |"
